I used the `ai` variant because moin.ai describes itself as an "Agentic AI platform for digital customer communication" (AI chatbot and agents, knowledge base, live chat, chat widget); the CV passed the checker (`CHECK OK`, 1 page) and the mail is written. Flags: moinAI publishes no tech stack; its jobs page has no open positions (spontaneous applications go to team@moin.ai); `companies.csv` has no contact name, so the mail opens with "Hello,"; and the site is mostly in German while the CV and mail are in English.
